title: Start
---
<<declare $met_shopkeeper = false>>
<<declare $asked_about_shop = false>>
<<declare $gold = 0 as number>>

<<if $met_shopkeeper>>
Shopkeeper: Back again, huh? What can I do you for?
<<else>>
Shopkeeper: Well met, traveler! Welcome to my shop.
<<set $met_shopkeeper = true>>
<<endif>>
-> Tell me about this place.
    <<jump AboutShop>>
-> I'd like to buy something.
    <<jump Shop>>
-> Got any rumors?
    <<jump Rumors>>
-> Nothing, just looking.
    Shopkeeper: Suit yourself. Come back anytime.
    <<stop>>
===

title: AboutShop
---
<<if $asked_about_shop>>
Shopkeeper: Like I said — three generations of fine goods.
<<else>>
<<set $asked_about_shop = true>>
Shopkeeper: This shop's been in my family for three generations. We specialize in rare trinkets and traveler's gear.
<<endif>>
<<jump Start>>
===

title: Shop
---
Shopkeeper: Take a look at my wares.
<<open_shop>>
-> Actually, never mind.
    <<jump Start>>
===

title: Rumors
---
<<if $gold >= 100>>
Shopkeeper: For someone as wealthy as you? I've heard the old mill is haunted.
<<else>>
Shopkeeper: Rumors aren't free, but I'll give you one — watch out for wolves on the north road.
<<endif>>
<<jump Start>>
===
